    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/1/51078.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 190,
    "turn_text": "I have a program on leadership at the George Mason University. Because of COVID, we haven't been able to do it as much, but we will be starting it back up. It's a summer program where we bring young women in high school, because we want young women in high school to really think about being leaders in a variety of professions. We want to expose them to business, politics, charities,",
